        stays at Status__c = 'Prepare' (nothing is written on rejection), the AdminOnly lock
        releases via the platform's ordinary post-rejection behaviour, and the record can be
        corrected and resubmitted - the same "parked for a re-pick" shape
        Disposition_Offer__c.Offer_Selection_Approval documents for its own rejection path. NOT
