        record, so NDA__c.Mark_Declined RENDERS (its criteria do not test a pending flag that
        does not exist on this object) and THROWS ENTITY_IS_LOCKED if clicked. That is a noisy
        refusal, not a silent one.

        approvalPageFields: Name, Owner, Disposition__c, Counterparty_Name__c, Party_Role__c,
